# MAGIC **Target:** `viz_ilab.codegen_bronze.cust_cobol_3`
# MAGIC **Generated by:** ingestion codegen prototype.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC Unlike the other generated notebooks in this project, this one does
# MAGIC **not** bake in a fixed schema — Cobrix re-derives the schema from
# MAGIC the copybook on every run instead. That's a deliberate exception to
